    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495730/extras/11592ffae0b1c52892e22dfea4de16cc.poster.avif?t=1754326102\" width=38 height=32 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495730/extras/11592ffae0b1c52892e22dfea4de16cc.webm?t=1754326102\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495730/extras/114a101872f3796107dc9eb6669beb91.webp?t=1754326102\" width=330 height=26 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495730/extras/11592ffae0b1c52892e22dfea4de16cc.poster.avif?t=1754326102\" width=38 height=32 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495730/extras/11592ffae0b1c52892e22dfea4de16cc.webm?t=1754326102\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Surreal, ethereal, and liminal environments<br></li><li> Infinite world generation, both vertically and horizontally<br></li><li> Cities made of plastic, infinite underground libraries, and massive warehouses to crawl</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495730/extras/11592ffae0b1c52892e22dfea4de16cc.poster.avif?t=1754326102\" width=38 height=32 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495730/extras/11592ffae0b1c52892e22dfea4de16cc.webm?t=1754326102\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495730/extras/b19ebf4b0022635ce1363e6ec67bff70.webp?t=1754326102\" width=111 height=26 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495730/extras/11592ffae0b1c52892e22dfea4de16cc.poster.avif?t=1754326102\" width=38 height=32 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495730/extras/11592ffae0b1c52892e22dfea4de16cc.webm?t=1754326102\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Fight unnerving creatures like manikins, higher-dimensional angels, and giant spiders<br></li><li> Craft items using your imagination with the boundless item fusion system<br></li><li>  Wield hookshots, explosives, swords, axes, and cute accessories in combat</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495730/extras/11592ffae0b1c52892e22dfea4de16cc.poster.avif?t=1754326102\" width=38 height=32 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495730/extras/11592ffae0b1c52892e22dfea4de16cc.webm?t=1754326102\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495730/extras/88230732ce942f579c05c3846d32793f.webp?t=1754326102\" width=98 height=26 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495730/extras/11592ffae0b1c52892e22dfea4de16cc.poster.avif?t=1754326102\" width=38 height=32 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495730/extras/11592ffae0b1c52892e22dfea4de16cc.webm?t=1754326102\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Build anything in a voxel sandbox using dozens of beautiful blocks <br></li><li> Control the elements to flood or set ablaze the world<br></li><li> Summon friendly bubblebears and sheep to fill the void</li></ul>",
